DESCRIPTION:Enjoy this fun\, outdoor family experience by exploring dazzling light displays\, taking family pictures or selfies with a variety of festive scenes\, and keeping warm with hot beverages and snacks! Plus\, new this year\, try your hand at lighted mini golf\, a scavenger hunt and a giant maze!Bright Nights is open for a magical experience throughout the holiday season\, making it the perfect destination for holiday cheer for the entire family! Reserve tickets now!Hours of Operation:&#x95\; November 14- November 22: Open weekends only\, 5-10 p.m.&#x95\; November 27-December 17: Monday - Thursday: 5-9 p.m. Friday - Sunday: 5-10 p.m.&#x95\; December 18-January 3: Nightly 5-10 p.m.\nLocated at 4001 Eisenhower Avenue\, Alexandria\, VA 22304For more information\, please visit novaparks.com/Lights
URL:https://novaparks.com/lights
