BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Open House at Code Ninjas Alexandria
DESCRIPTION:Code Ninjas Alexandria is celebrating our 7th Anniversary! Join us for an inside look at Code Ninjas and discover how kids build technology.OPEN HOUSE at Code Ninjas Alexandria celebrating our 7th YEAR in Alexandria!Join us on November 21\, 2026 at 2:00 PM for an exciting Open House event at Code Ninjas Alexandria! This is a fantastic opportunity to explore the venue\, meet the team\, and discover what makes Code Ninjas a unique place for learning and fun.Don't miss your chance to experience the energy and innovation in person. We look forward to welcoming you! Join us for our 7th Anniversary Open House\, get an inside look at Code Ninjas and discover how kids build technology skills\, confidence\, and creativity through coding\, robotics\, AI\, hands-on STEM projects\, and competitive youth esports.What to Expect:Meet our team of Directors\, Code Senseis\, and Esports CoachesSee examples of projects students createTour our dojo-style learning environmentExplore coding\, robotics\, and AI programs for ages 5-14Discover the world of competitive youth esports with a free coaching session for kids ages 7-17Get answers to your questions and learn about enrollment optionsAND enjoy drinks\, snacks\, prizes\, raffles and deals during the Open House!
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/168431/t/tickets
