BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:26th Annual Alexandria Holiday Boat Parade of Lights sponsored by Amazon
DESCRIPTION:Old Town Alexandria’s historic waterfront will shine for the 26th Annual Alexandria Holiday Boat Parade of Lights sponsored by Amazon features dozens of brightly lit boats cruise along one mile of the Potomac River shoreline. Enjoy dockside festivities in Waterfront Park including a pop-up beer garden from Port City Brewing Company\, food\, activities and more.\n\nMore information will be posted to this page when available. To reach this year’s parade organizers\, please email specialevents@alexandriava.gov.
URL:https://www.alexandriava.gov/HolidayParades
