BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:55th Annual Alexandria Scottish Walk Holiday Parade Sponsored by Wegmans
DESCRIPTION:The Alexandria Scottish Walk Holiday Parade started as a community event more than 50 years ago to highlight the city’s Scottish heritage and support the mission of the Campagna Center\, then known as the Community Y. The Campagna Center partnered with St. Andrew’s Society Washington\, DC\, Old Presbyterian Meeting House and the City of Alexandria to produce the parade and associated events led by Junior and Supporting Friends of the Campagna Center.\n\nIn 2026\, to elevate this signature event as an ongoing source of civic pride and celebration of Alexandria and its communities\, the City of Alexandria took on the role of lead parade producer\, with additional support by the Campagna Center and Visit Alexandria.\n\nDate: Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\n\nTime: 10:30 am - 12:30 pm ET\n\nLocation: Old Town Alexandria. New Route Information Coming Soon!
URL:https://www.alexandriava.gov/HolidayParades
