BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:This is Halloween: A Community Concert
DESCRIPTION:Come in costume and bring the whole family to kick off Halloween with a friendly\, festive concert of songs and spooky favorites! This is Halloween: A Community Concert is a FREE concert with all donations benefiting the Campagna Center - a perfect way to lead up to the excitement of trick-or-treating! Join the Alexandria Children's Chorus\, Alexandria Singers\, and an ensemble of musicians from the Washington Metropolitan Philharmonic as they perform a spirited mix of spook-tacular music\, sure to delight goblins\, dragons\, ghosts\, and the like. Candy to follow.\nThis organizations included in this event include: Campagna Center\, the Alexandria Children's Chorus\, bout the Alexandria Singers\, The Washington Metropolitan Philharmonic Association (WMPA)
