BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Arielle Shoshana Perfume: Experimental Perfume Club Blending Masterclass
DESCRIPTION:The Experimental Perfume Club x Arielle Shoshana Blending Masterclass returns!\nThe Blending Masterclass is Experimental Perfume Club's signature hands-on fragrance experience\, designed to educate\, inspire\, and immerse guests in the Art of Blending by EPC.\nLed by our founder\, master perfumer Emmanuelle Moeglin\, participants are guided through the principles of fragrance composition\, exploring EPC's award-winning collection of Blendable Eau de Parfum\, understanding the science behind scent structure\, and learning how to create a balanced perfume.\nEach guest will blend their own bespoke fragrance\, resulting in a unique\, personalized scent to take home in a beautifully labelled bottle.\nA celebration of creativity\, craftsmanship\, and individuality\, this collaboration between Experimental Perfume Club and Arielle Shoshana offers guests a rare opportunity to create their own olfactory masterpiece.\nSpaces are limited. Early booking is strongly recommended. Please arrive promptly at the beginning of your ticketed time slot\, as the masterclass will begin at the scheduled time regardless of late arrivals.\nIf you will be driving\, we strongly recommend factoring in extra time to find parking. Here are the closest parking lots!\nIf you have ordered a ticket and need to switch to a different time slot\, please email us at info@arielleshoshana.com. We will do our best to reschedule you if possible.
URL:https://www.arielleshoshana.com/products/masterclass
