BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Birchmere - Laurel Canyon - Alexandria
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable night as Laurel Canyon takes the stage at the Birchmere Music Hall in Alexandria\, Virginia! Known for its intimate atmosphere and rich musical heritage\, this iconic venue is the perfect setting for an evening filled with captivating melodies and heartfelt lyrics. Experience the magic of Laurel Canyon as they bring their unique sound to life\, blending alternative vibes with a touch of nostalgia that will resonate with fans old and new.Don't miss your chance to be part of this special event\, ""Laurel Canyon - Alexandria Alexandria."" Gather your friends and immerse yourself in the enchanting ambiance of the Birchmere Music Hall\, where every note feels like a warm embrace. Grab your tickets now and get ready for a night of music that will leave you inspired!
URL:https://www.findtick.com/tickets/8226931/laurel-canyon-alexandria-tickets-fri-jan-15-2027-birchmere-music-hall?utm_source=citiesevent
