BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trivia Night at Historic Sites - Halloween
DESCRIPTION:Staff members at Carlyle House Historic Park combine their knowledge to create a spooky fun Trivia in honor of Halloween. Test your knowledge on everything Halloween from general facts to movies to food.\nRegistration must be done in advance. Limited capacity so register early!\nTickets are $15 per person and includes snacks and mocktails. Teams are limited to 6 people. No outside alcohol is allowed. \n \nLink: http://apm.activecommunities.com/novaparks/Activity_Search/10375
URL:http://apm.activecommunities.com/novaparks/Activity_Search/10375
