BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trick-or-Treating at Mount Vernon
DESCRIPTION:Collect candy around the historic grounds and celebrate Halloween with 18th-century entertainment and activities.\nHear live musical performances\, see soap-making and blacksmith demonstrations\, and meet George and Martha Washington.\nPlus\, kids can enjoy a free meal at the Mount Vernon Inn Restaurant from 5 p.m. to 8 p.m.
