BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lee-Fendall: Pumpkin Palooza
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate spooky season at the Lee-Fendall House! Bring the whole family for an afternoon of fall-themed fun!\nCelebrate spooky season at the Lee-Fendall House &amp\; bring the whole family for an afternoon of fall-themed fun! Activities will include pumpkin decorating\, a craft station\, face painting\, and games.\nAdmission includes up to 2 pumpkins per family. Pumpkin Palooza will occur rain or shine. In the event of inclement weather\, ticket price (not including fees) will be refunded.\n$20 / child\n$10 / adult\nIt is strongly recommended to purchase tickets in advance\, as walk-ups will not be guaranteed admission/pumpkins.\nPlease email contact@leefendallhouse.org or call (703) 548 - 1789 with any questions.
