BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lee-Fendall: Haunted Lantern Tours
DESCRIPTION:Tour the historic Lee-Fendall House at night by lantern light! Learn about the history of the home on this spooky\, guided experience.\nTake a tour of the historic Lee-Fendall House at night! A quieter\, cozier experience in Old Town Alexandria\, this tour covers the history of the house and the ghostly stories from within its walls. As you are led through the first and second floors of the home by the light of lantern\, you might just hear or see something spooky along the way.\nHaunted Lantern Tours will be at 7:00pm &amp\; 8:00pm on October 30th &amp\; 31st.\nThe lantern tours are recommended for ages 12+. Each tour time is limited to 12 people.\nTickets are $20 per person. The tour last about 45 minutes.
