SUMMARY:Llyod House: ACRP Discerning Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Alexandria Community Remembrance Project (ACRP) Discerning Dinner - Nov 5\, 2026 Reserve space at a Discerning Dinner and join the conversation while supporting the Alexandria Community Remembrance Project's Memorial Scholarship Program. Each academic year\, ACRP invites guest speakers to lead participants in meaningful conversation while enjoying a simple dinner together.The topic will be the Underground Railroad with Tony Cohen.To officially register for this event:Step One: Reserve your place at the table at Alexandriava.gov/Shop (This is only a reservation\; no money will be deducted from your account.)Step Two: Donate $40 to ACRP's Memorial Scholarship Program. Link to donate available at Alexandriava.gov/Shop and click Tickets (Please do not donate anonymously\, instead leave your last name and &#x93\;for Cohen Dinner&#x94\; so we can track your purchase.)
