BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:King & Rye: Cocktails & Crafts
DESCRIPTION:Sip. Create. Stay awhile.\nYour evening plans just got a creative upgrade. Join us for nightly Cocktails &amp\; Crafts in our outdoor courtyard &#x96\; where your table becomes your studio. Sip\, snack\, and explore curated DIY kits delivered right to your table in a relaxed\, creative summer setting. From mini crochet kits to vibrant watercolor canvas\, cocktail napkin embroidery\, and scenic diamond art\, we have something for every kind of crafter!\nAvailable nightly:\nTuesday-Thursday 5-10 PM\nFriday-Saturday 5-11 PM\nSunday 5-9 PM\n \nAdmission is free with a reservation\; cocktails\, bites\, and DIY craft kits are available for purchase.\nYour reservation will be for our outdoor courtyard. If forecast is calling for inclement weather\, your table will be moved inside of King &amp\; Rye.
URL:https://www.opentable.com/booking/experiences-availability?rid=18718&restref=18718&experienceId=754355&utm_source=external&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=shared
