BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Washington Metropolitan Philharmonic Association: Power & Possibility
DESCRIPTION:POWER &amp\; POSSIBILITYa Side-By-Side Concert with Washington Metropolitan Youth OrchestraSunday\, May 23 | 3 pm| Schlesinger Concert | Hall Anna Binneweg\, Conductor| Ieva Jokubavičiūtė\, piano\nJoin us for the season finale Power &amp\; Possibility\, a Side-By-Side Concert with the Washington Metropolitan Youth Orchestra\, featuring Ieva Jokubavičiūtė on piano. This program begins with The Young Person's Guide to the Orchestra\, Op. 34 by Benjamin Britten\, followed by Piano Concerto by Grażyna Bacewicz\, inspired by Polish folklore\, and ends with the Finnish Symphony No. 2 in D Major\, Op. 43 by Jean Sibelius.
URL:https://www.wmpamusic.org/concerts.html
