SUMMARY:Paperweight Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Torpedo Factory artist Alison Sigethy for a fun Factory tour and paperweight workshop. Paperweights will be fired and ready for pickup in approximately 2-3 days. If you are not local\,your paperweight can be shipped to you for a flat rate of $10.\nSign up in Studio 335 at the Torpedo Factory Art Center\, or text Alison @ 703-980-2948.Payment in full reserves your spot. Payment is non-refundable\, but fully transferable.
