BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Christmas Market & Holiday Craft Show
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the biggest Christmas market in Old Town Alexandria\, the Old Town Alexandria Christmas Market &amp\; Holiday Craft Show! This festive event is a holiday shopper's dream\, featuring tons of seasonal items like unique gifts\, holiday décor\, and more\, all crafted by talented local artisans. With carolers filling the air with joyous tunes and a DJ spinning holiday classics\, it's sure to get you in the spirit of the season.\nWhat to Expect:\n\nThe Largest Holiday Market in Old Town Alexandria: Shop from a wide selection of seasonal items including handmade gifts\, ornaments\, decorations\, and more from local artisans and crafters.\nCarolers and DJ Holiday Music: Enjoy festive music from carolers and a DJ playing your favorite holiday hits throughout the day.\nFood &amp\; Beverages: Warm up with delicious holiday treats\, savory food\, and festive drinks to keep your spirits high.\nKids Ornament Creation Station: Bring the little ones to our craft station where they can create their own holiday ornaments to take home.\nPictures with Santa: Don't forget to get your picture with Santa and create memories that will last a lifetime!\nParking: Parking is available on nearby streets and parking garages\n\nRain or Shine Event
URL:https://www.thecarlylecommunity.com/carlyle-events/the-old-town-alexandria-christmas-market-holiday-craft-show-2026
DTSTART:20261212T110000
DTEND:20261212T170000
LOCATION:300 John Carlyle Street
GEO:38.803616;-77.061663
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=300 John Carlyle Street;X-APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=:geo:38.803616,-77.061663
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alexandria Fall-O-Ween
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a family-friendly Halloween celebration at Alexandria Fall-O-Ween! This exciting event is packed with arts &amp\; crafts\, delicious treats\, and a day of fun for the whole family. Whether you're looking to shop for handmade Halloween décor\, indulge in sweet treats\, or watch a costume parade\, this festival has it all.\nCome enjoy a spooktacular day with arts\, crafts\, treats\, and lots of Halloween fun for the whole family!\nWhat to Expect:\n\nHandmade Arts &amp\; Crafts: Browse a variety of local artisans offering unique Halloween-themed décor\, fall-inspired jewelry\, and one-of-a-kind home goods&#x97\;perfect for adding a personal touch to your celebrations.\nDelicious Treats &amp\; Desserts: Satisfy your sweet tooth with an assortment of Halloween-inspired goodies including cupcakes\, cookies\, and other festive desserts for all ages to enjoy.\nBeer Garden: Enjoy a refreshing drink from our beer garden! Relax and sip on your favorite beer while taking in the sights and sounds of the festival.\nFun for the Whole Family: Kids can enjoy pumpkin painting\, face painting\, and other Halloween-themed activities\, making it the perfect day of fun for everyone!\n\nParking: Parking available on nearby streets and garages\nRain or Shine Event
URL:https://www.thecarlylecommunity.com/carlyle-events/alexandria-fall-o-ween-2026
DTSTART:20261031T110000
DTEND:20261031T170000
LOCATION:300 John Carlyle Street
GEO:38.803616;-77.061663
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=300 John Carlyle Street;X-APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=:geo:38.803616,-77.061663
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tabletop Takeover
DESCRIPTION:Roll the dice\, shuffle the deck\, and let the games begin!\nJoin us on the last Sunday of every month for Tabletop Takeover at Port City Brewing Co. Starting at 3pm\, we'll set aside tables in our Indoor Beer Garden for an afternoon of board games\, card games\, puzzles\, dominoes\, and more. We'll have a great selection of games ready to go\, so you can jump in with friends&#x97\;old and new&#x97\;or bring along your favorite game to share and teach. \nCold beer\, good company\, and friendly competition guaranteed!
URL:https://www.portcitybrewing.com/
DTSTART:20261025T150000
DTEND:20261025T190000
LOCATION:3950 Wheeler Avenue
GEO:38.807998;-77.101501
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=3950 Wheeler Avenue;X-APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Port City Brewing Company:geo:38.807998,-77.101501
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
