BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pedals & Pints - Long Ride
DESCRIPTION:Pedals &amp\; Pints will get you hopped up on cycling!   Port City and Handy Bikes have teamed up to co-host approachable\, fun\, no-drop group rides twice a month.  Pedals &amp\; Pints rides depart from Handy Bikes retail showroom at 3800 Wheeler Ave\, and end at Port City Brewing at 3950 Wheeler Ave.  \nThere are two rides to choose from:\nShort Ride:  2nd Saturday of each month -- A punchy 10 mile ride\, departing the retail showroom at 10:30am.  Avg pace 10mph\, no drop.   A few steep but short hills.  Returns to Port City &amp\; La Tingeria for beer and/or tacos around 12pm.\nLong Ride:  4th Saturday of each month -- A 20-30 mile varying route\, departing the retail showroom at 10:30am.  Avg pace 12-14mph\, no drop\; expect several moderate hills. Returns to Port City &amp\; La Tingeria for beer and/or tacos around 12:30-1pm.\nRiders of all ages who have the confidence and skill to participate in a group ride setting are invited.  Road bikes and flashing lights are encouraged\; helmets are mandatory.  E-bikes (class 1\, 2\, or 3 only) are welcome at all rides.  Routes may include sections of road that do not have protected bike lanes.  All participants must sign a waiver before riding.\nFor more information and to RSVP for the ride\, please visit https://meetup.com/handybikes or https://handybikesdc.com/for/rides  age. 
URL:https://www.handybikesdc.com/articles/rides-classes-events-pg225.htm
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
LOCATION:3950 Wheeler Avenue
GEO:38.807998;-77.101501
