BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Joggers & Lagers
DESCRIPTION:Start your week off with a Monday evening run from Port City Brewing Company.\nThe run meets at the brewery tasting room before heading out for a 1\, 3 or 5 mile run (it's an out and back route so really it's as long as you care to make it). It's a pleasant route through a park and then picking up a paved path along Holmes Run.\nExpect a fun crowd\, support from Pacers Running staff\, and occasionally vendors will be there with shoes to try out on the run.
URL:https://www.portcitybrewing.com/
