BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:19th Annual Santa Railway Express Train
DESCRIPTION:This annual holiday tradition\, now in its 19th year\, features a roundtrip train ride with Santa from the Alexandria train station to Manassas.\nTickets for the popular Santa Train are available at Alexandria's Whistle Stop Toy &amp\; Hobby Store\, located at 1719 Centre Plaza\, just off Quaker Lane.\nThe fun starts at the Alexandria train station\, where those boarding the train begin to gather at 1 p.m. During the train ride\, from 1:25-3:30 p.m.\, Santa visits and takes photos with ticket-holders who also receive stickers and candy canes.\n\nOnce the train reaches the Manassas train station\, everyone gets off the train for 30 minutes for hot chocolate\, water and cookies\, and a fun story-time with one of Santa's elves and a Q&amp\;A with Santa. Then it's back on the train for the ride back to Alexandria.\n\nThere is a maximum of 200 tickets sold for each Santa Train ride. Tickets are $29.99 each and can only be purchased in person at Whistle Stop Toy &amp\; Hobby Store.
URL:https://www.whistlestophobbies.com/annual-santa-train/
DTSTART:00251201T130000
DTEND:00251201T160000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
