BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AR Workshop Alexandria: NEW Beginner Embroidery Workshop!
DESCRIPTION:Come learn the basics of this beautiful art form with us in an instructor-led class. Guests will learn the most popular 3 stitches as well as take home a mini embroidery kit (hoop\, needles\, threader\, etc.) to practice anytime and anywhere! \nFeel free to bring your own item to embroider or work on a kit provided in the workshop. The instructed portion of this workshop lasts approximately 1.5 hours. If you bring in a personal item or purchase an item from our retail boutique\, plan on an additional 30 mins to get your stitching started with the help of our instructors!\nVisit our homepage to register\, times vary by date.
URL:https://www.arworkshop.com/alexandria/#schedule
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
