BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AR Workshop Alexandria: SIGNATURE Wood\, Canvas + Textured Art Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this fun-filled DIY workshop!\nCreate a unique home decor item utilizing a variety of tools and techniques and our in-house collection of paints and non-toxic stains while guided by our crafty instructors.\nThis is our most popular workshop featuring our Signature Wood\, Canvas\, and Textured Art projects\, to include plank and framed signs\, rounds\, trays\, boxes and canvas pillows. This is a 2.5 to 3 hour DIY experience.\nMultiple classes per week. See our full calendar and register here: https://www.arworkshop.com/alexandria/#schedule
URL:https://www.arworkshop.com/alexandria/#schedule
